sequenceDiagram
  box transparent host network namespace
    participant app as musl program<br/>in the sandbox
    participant mon as hallpass<br/>monitor
    participant fwd as hallpass<br/>DNS forwarder<br/>127.0.0.1:P
    participant res as systemd-resolved<br/>127.0.0.53:53
  end
  participant gh as api.github.com<br/>140.82.121.6

  rect rgba(214,39,40,0.15)
    app-)mon: sendto(udp, 127.0.0.53:53, query) — trapped<br/>(once for A, once for AAAA)
    mon--)app: emulate: send to 127.0.0.1:P instead,<br/>on a copy of the socket
  end
  fwd->>res: queries
  res->>fwd: answers
  Note over fwd: record<br/>api.github.com<br/>= 140.82.121.6
  fwd->>app: answers, from 127.0.0.1:P
  rect rgba(214,39,40,0.15)
    app-)mon: recvmsg(…) — trapped
    mon--)app: emulate: receive on a copy of the socket,<br/>source 127.0.0.53:53
  end
  rect rgba(214,39,40,0.15)
    app-)mon: connect(tcp, 140.82.121.6:443) — trapped
    Note over mon: rules for<br/>api.github.com:<br/>allow
    mon--)app: continue: the kernel connects
  end
  app->>gh: TLS, direct
